{"text":"<p><span>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gwLaf5-qefU</span></p><p>### 2-1. Sahetukaduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-38-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1. Kusalapadaṃ ^7-38a-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-6. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-38b-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetu-ārammaṇapaccayā</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15419.04745097139\">4:16:59</span> 1. Sahetukaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca sahetuko kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-38b-1</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15430.2273121297\">4:17:10</span> Sahetukaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca sahetuko kusalo dhammo uppajjati ārammaṇapaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15437.55065491989\">4:17:17</span> 2. Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ, adhipatiyā ekaṃ, anantare ekaṃ, samanantare ekaṃ, sahajāte ekaṃ, aññamaññe ekaṃ, nissaye ekaṃ, upanissaye ekaṃ, purejāte ekaṃ, āsevane ekaṃ, kamme ekaṃ, āhāre ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-38b-2</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccanīyaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Naadhipatipaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15461.370388038147\">4:17:41</span> 3. Sahetukaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca sahetuko kusalo dhammo uppajjati naadhipatipaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-38b-3</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15474.490004026702\">4:17:54</span> 4. Naadhipatiyā ekaṃ, napurejāte ekaṃ, napacchājāte ekaṃ, naāsevane ekaṃ, nakamme ekaṃ, navipāke ekaṃ, navippayutte ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-38b-4</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15489.923453856949\">4:18:09</span> Hetupaccayā naadhipatiyā ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15493.358697791145\">4:18:13</span> Naadhipatipaccayā hetuyā ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15497.117963220298\">4:18:17</span> (Sahajātavāropi paccayavāropi nissayavāropi saṃsaṭṭhavāropi sampayuttavāropi paṭiccavārasadisā vitthāretabbā.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 7. Pañhāvāro ^7-38c-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetu-ārammaṇapaccayā</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15510.265295954701\">4:18:30</span> 5. Sahetuko kusalo dhammo sahetukassa kusalassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) ^7-38c-5</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15520.907395854565\">4:18:40</span> Sahetuko kusalo dhammo sahetukassa kusalassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15529.327442195503\">4:18:49</span> 6. Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ, adhipatiyā ekaṃ, anantare ekaṃ, samanantare ekaṃ, sahajāte ekaṃ, aññamaññe ekaṃ, nissaye ekaṃ, upanissaye ekaṃ, āsevane ekaṃ, kamme ekaṃ, āhāre ekaṃ, indriye ekaṃ, jhāne ekaṃ, magge ekaṃ, sampayutte ekaṃ, atthiyā ekaṃ, natthiyā ekaṃ, vigate ekaṃ, avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-38c-6</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccanīyuddhāro</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15563.521595131608\">4:19:23</span> 7. Sahetuko kusalo dhammo sahetukassa kusalassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… sahajātapaccayena paccayo… upanissayapaccayena paccayo. ^7-38c-7</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15575.878563925613\">4:19:35</span> 8. Nahetuyā ekaṃ, naārammaṇe ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-38c-8</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15580.477383994277\">4:19:40</span> Hetupaccayā naārammaṇe ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15583.52741611158\">4:19:43</span> Nahetupaccayā ārammaṇe ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15587.455230874115\">4:19:47</span> (Yathā kusalattike pañhāvārassa anulomampi paccanīyampi anulomapaccanīyampi paccanīyānulomampi gaṇitaṃ, evaṃ gaṇetabbaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 2. Akusalapadaṃ ^7-38d-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-6. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-38e-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetu-ārammaṇapaccayādi</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15600.320275137328\">4:20:00</span> 9. Sahetukaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca sahetuko akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-38e-9</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15611.688248071525\">4:20:11</span> Ahetukaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca sahetuko akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15619.388624048637\">4:20:19</span> Sahetukaṃ akusalañca ahetukaṃ akusalañca dhammaṃ paṭicca sahetuko akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15630.532173203514\">4:20:30</span> <span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15630.42065008297\">4:20:30</span> Sahetukaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca sahetuko akusalo dhammo uppajjati ārammaṇapaccayā. Sahetukaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca ahetuko akusalo dhammo uppajjati ārammaṇapaccayā. Sahetukaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca sahetuko akusalo ca ahetuko akusalo ca dhammā uppajjanti ārammaṇapaccayā. (3)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15658.366743909783\">4:20:58</span> Ahetukaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca sahetuko akusalo dhammo uppajjati ārammaṇapaccayā. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p>Sahetukaṃ akusalañca ahetukaṃ akusalañca dhammaṃ paṭicca sahetuko akusalo dhammo uppajjati ārammaṇapaccayā. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p>Sahetukaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca sahetuko akusalo dhammo uppajjati adhipatipaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15666.388410972724\">4:21:06</span> 10. Hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe pañca, adhipatiyā ekaṃ, anantare pañca, samanantare pañca, sahajāte pañca, aññamaññe pañca, nissaye pañca, upanissaye pañca, purejāte pañca, āsevane pañca, kamme pañca, āhāre pañca, indriye pañca, jhāne pañca, magge pañca, sampayutte pañca, vippayutte pañca, atthiyā pañca, natthiyā pañca, vigate pañca, avigate pañca (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-38e-10</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Nahetu-naadhipatipaccayā</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15702.66341791703\">4:21:42</span> 11. Sahetukaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca ahetuko akusalo dhammo uppajjati nahetupaccayā. (1) ^7-38e-11</p><p><br /></p><p>Sahetukaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca sahetuko akusalo dhammo uppajjati naadhipatipaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15711.1959418312\">4:21:51</span> 12. Nahetuyā ekaṃ, naadhipatiyā pañca, napurejāte pañca, napacchājāte pañca, naāsevane pañca, nakamme tīṇi, navipāke pañca, navippayutte pañca (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-38e-12</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15727.539759908448\">4:22:07</span> Hetupaccayā naadhipatiyā tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15730.383124094415\">4:22:10</span> Nahetupaccayā ārammaṇe ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15734.686687868392\">4:22:14</span> (Sahajātavāropi paccayavāropi nissayavāropi saṃsaṭṭhavāropi sampayuttavāropi paṭiccavārasadisā vitthāretabbā.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 7. Pañhāvāro ^7-38f-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetu-ārammaṇapaccayādi</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15747.088342685287\">4:22:27</span> 13. Sahetuko akusalo dhammo sahetukassa akusalassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo… dve. ^7-38f-13</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15757.805377854087\">4:22:37</span> Sahetuko akusalo dhammo sahetukassa akusalassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15768.42418527752\">4:22:48</span> Ahetuko akusalo dhammo ahetukassa akusalassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15776.88169811158\">4:22:56</span> Sahetuko akusalo ca ahetuko akusalo ca dhammā sahetukassa akusalassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15787.549920022888\">4:23:07</span> Sahetuko akusalo dhammo sahetukassa akusalassa dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo – ārammaṇādhipati, sahajātādhipati (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15798.652029985695\">4:23:18</span> 14. Hetuyā dve, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā ekaṃ, anantare nava, samanantare nava, sahajāte pañca, aññamaññe pañca, nissaye pañca, upanissaye nava, āsevane nava, kamme tīṇi, āhāre tīṇi, indriye tīṇi, jhāne tīṇi, magge tīṇi, sampayutte pañca, atthiyā pañca, natthiyā nava, vigate nava, avigate pañca (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-38f-14</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccanīyuddhāro</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15827.486548897003\">4:23:47</span> 15. Sahetuko akusalo dhammo sahetukassa akusalassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… sahajātapaccayena paccayo… upanissayapaccayena paccayo (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-38f-15</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15839.421270208855\">4:23:59</span> 16. Nahetuyā nava, naārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-38f-16</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15843.326866957084\">4:24:03</span> Hetupaccayā naārammaṇe dve (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15846.417791925613\">4:24:06</span> Nahetupaccayā ārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15850.043855905586\">4:24:10</span> (Yathā kusalattike pañhāvārassa anulomampi paccanīyampi anulomapaccanīyampi paccanīyānulomampi gaṇitaṃ, evaṃ gaṇetabbaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 3. Abyākatapadaṃ ^7-38g-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-6. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-38h-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15862.305851160218\">4:24:22</span> 17. Sahetukaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca sahetuko abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi. ^7-38h-17</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15873.935698082969\">4:24:33</span> Ahetukaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca ahetuko abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15883.868839799728\">4:24:43</span> Sahetukaṃ abyākatañca ahetukaṃ abyākatañca dhammaṃ paṭicca sahetuko abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15899.015955017167\">4:24:59</span> 18. Hetuyā nava, ārammaṇe cattāri, adhipatiyā pañca, anantare cattāri, samanantare cattāri, sahajāte nava, aññamaññe cha…pe… purejāte dve, āsevane dve, kamme nava, vipāke nava…pe… vippayutte nava…pe… avigate nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-38h-18</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Nahetu-naārammaṇapaccayā</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15919.066329825477\">4:25:19</span> 19. Ahetukaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca ahetuko abyākato dhammo uppajjati nahetupaccayā. (1) ^7-38h-19</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15927.912543925613\">4:25:27</span> Sahetukaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca ahetuko abyākato dhammo uppajjati naārammaṇapaccayā. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15937.499292865532\">4:25:37</span> Ahetukaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca ahetuko abyākato dhammo uppajjati naārammaṇapaccayā. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15947.215678951363\">4:25:47</span> Sahetukaṃ abyākatañca ahetukaṃ abyākatañca dhammaṃ paṭicca ahetuko abyākato dhammo uppajjati naārammaṇapaccayā. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15958.920480037194\">4:25:58</span> Sahetukaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca sahetuko abyākato dhammo uppajjati naadhipatipaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15967.784408154495\">4:26:07</span> 20. Nahetuyā ekaṃ, naārammaṇe tīṇi, naadhipatiyā nava, naanantare tīṇi, nasamanantare tīṇi, naaññamaññe tīṇi, naupanissaye tīṇi, napurejāte nava, napacchājāte nava, naāsevane nava, nakamme dve, navipāke pañca, naāhāre ekaṃ, naindriye ekaṃ, najhāne ekaṃ, namagge ekaṃ, nasampayutte tīṇi, navippayutte dve, nonatthiyā tīṇi, novigate tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-38h-20</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16006.292419808311\">4:26:46</span> Hetupaccayā naārammaṇe tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16009.769229048637\">4:26:49</span> Nahetupaccayā ārammaṇe ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16013.966570220298\">4:26:53</span> (Sahajātavāropi paccayavāropi nissayavāropi saṃsaṭṭhavāropi sampayuttavāropi paṭiccavārasadisā vitthāretabbā.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 7. Pañhāvāro ^7-38i-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetu-ārammaṇapaccayā</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16027.071702208854\">4:27:07</span> 21. Sahetuko abyākato dhammo sahetukassa abyākatassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. ^7-38i-21</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16039.739266062943\">4:27:19</span> Sahetuko abyākato dhammo sahetukassa abyākatassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16048.642871868393\">4:27:28</span> 22. Hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe cattāri, adhipatiyā cattāri, anantare cattāri, samanantare cattāri, sahajāte satta, aññamaññe cha, nissaye satta, upanissaye cattāri, purejāte dve, pacchājāte dve, āsevane dve, kamme cattāri, vipāke cattāri, āhāre cattāri, indriye cattāri, jhāne cattāri, magge tīṇi, sampayutte dve, vippayutte tīṇi, atthiyā satta…pe… avigate satta (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-38i-22</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccanīyuddhāro</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16085.134240114441\">4:28:05</span> 23. Sahetuko abyākato dhammo sahetukassa abyākatassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… sahajātapaccayena paccayo… upanissayapaccayena paccayo (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-38i-23</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16098.357254839782\">4:28:18</span> 24. Nahetuyā satta, naārammaṇe satta (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-38i-24</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16102.377073014306\">4:28:22</span> Hetupaccayā naārammaṇe tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16105.76396605722\">4:28:25</span> Nahetupaccayā ārammaṇe cattāri (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16109.2428708312\">4:28:29</span> (Yathā kusalattike pañhāvārassa anulomampi paccanīyampi anulomapaccanīyampi paccanīyānulomampi gaṇitaṃ, evaṃ gaṇetabbaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>Sahetukadukakusalattikaṃ niṭṭhitaṃ.</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 3-1. Hetusampayuttaduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-38j-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1. Kusalapadaṃ ^7-38k-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-6. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-38l-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16134.10121302861\">4:28:54</span> 25. Hetusampayuttaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca hetusampayutto kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.) ^7-38l-25</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16148.540939922752\">4:29:08</span> 26. Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ, adhipatiyā ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-38l-26</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccanīyaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16155.29606806008\">4:29:15</span> 27. Naadhipatiyā ekaṃ, napurejāte ekaṃ, napacchājāte ekaṃ, naāsevane ekaṃ, nakamme ekaṃ, navipāke ekaṃ, navippayutte ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-38l-27</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16170.135090042915\">4:29:30</span> Hetupaccayā naadhipatiyā ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16173.337